# Phase 2 Vercel — copy into the Vercel project (Build + Runtime). Never commit secrets.
# Root Directory of the Vercel project must be `frontend`.
#
# Required on Vercel (Build and/or Runtime). Railway HTTPS origin from Phase 1. No trailing slash.
# Example: https://zomato-api-production.up.railway.app
API_ORIGIN=

# Do not set GROQ_API_KEY, LLM_API_KEY, or any NEXT_PUBLIC_* LLM keys here.
# The browser only calls same-origin /api/*; Next rewrites those to API_ORIGIN.
